---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import SystemDiagram from "../components/illustrations/SystemDiagram.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="About — Algorims" description="Algorims is an AWS Advanced Consulting Partner engineering autonomous AI, data, and cloud systems for the enterprise.">
<div class="about-page">
<section class="about-hero py-20 lg:py-12">
    <div class="container-x">
      <div class="grid items-center gap-10 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-14">
        <div class="space-y-6 lg:col-span-7">

          <p class="about-kicker">About Algorims</p>
          <h1 class="text-5xl font-semibold leading-[1.05] tracking-tight md:text-6xl">The Future of <span>Enterprise</span> <span class="nowrap">Starts Here.</span></h1>
          <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">From cloud pioneers to agentic AI leaders — this is the story of a firm built to be different from day one.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="lg:col-span-5">

          <SystemDiagram />

        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-12">
    <div class="container-x">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-8">
        <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">

          <p class="about-kicker">Origin</p>
          <h2 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-semibold leading-[1.05] tracking-tight md:text-5xl">Why we <span class="text-gradient">exist</span></h2>
        </div>
        <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl space-y-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
          <p>In 2023, Algorims was founded on a single, uncompromising conviction — that enterprises deserve one trusted partner with the depth to do it all. A firm that could architect bulletproof cloud foundations, engineer world-class DevOps pipelines, and deploy cutting-edge agentic AI systems — not as separate services, but as one unified, intelligent capability.</p>
          <p class="text-foreground">Today, Algorims stands at the intersection of cloud excellence and autonomous intelligence — a firm that was never built to follow the market, but to lead it.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-12">
    <div class="container-x">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl space-y-3 text-center">

        <p class="about-kicker">Direction</p>
        <h2 class="text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight md:text-5xl">What drives us <span class="text-gradient">forward</span></h2>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-10 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">

          <div class="mission-card rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card p-8 transition-all hover:border-primary/30 hover:shadow-md lg:p-10">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
              <div class="mission-icon grid h-12 w-12 place-items-center rounded-2xl bg-primary/10 text-primary"><i data-lucide="target" class="!h-6 !w-6"></i></div>
              <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-primary">Mission</p>
            </div>
            <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground/90">To empower enterprises with the cloud foundations, engineering excellence, and agentic AI capabilities they need to operate smarter, move faster, and lead their industries with confidence.</p>
            <p class="mt-5 text-sm italic leading-relaxed text-primary/90">Turning enterprise ambition into autonomous, intelligent reality.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="mission-card rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card p-8 transition-all hover:border-primary/30 hover:shadow-md lg:p-10">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
              <div class="mission-icon grid h-12 w-12 place-items-center rounded-2xl bg-primary/10 text-primary"><i data-lucide="telescope" class="!h-6 !w-6"></i></div>
              <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-primary">Vision</p>
            </div>
            <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground/90">A world where every enterprise runs on intelligent, autonomous systems — where technology doesn't just support the business, but actively drives it forward and compounds its value.</p>
            <p class="mt-5 text-sm italic leading-relaxed text-primary/90">Every enterprise, autonomously intelligent.</p>
          </div>

      </div>

      <div class="mt-14 border-t border-border pt-12">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-8">
          <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
            <h3 class="text-3xl font-semibold leading-[1.1] tracking-tight md:text-4xl">How it becomes <span class="text-gradient">delivery</span></h3>
          </div>
          <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl space-y-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
            <p>We don't parachute in with generic frameworks. We embed alongside your teams, immerse ourselves in your business, and identify the highest-impact opportunities where agentic AI and cloud engineering can create real, measurable change.</p>
            <p>From architecting intelligent workflows and deploying production-grade AI agents to building enterprise cloud foundations and scaling autonomous operations — we co-create solutions that are deeply aligned with your business goals, engineered to last, and built to evolve.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-12">
    <div class="container-x">
      <div class="rounded-3xl bg-secondary/40 p-8 md:p-12 lg:p-14">
        <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl space-y-3 text-center">

          <p class="about-kicker">Principles</p>
          <h2 class="text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight md:text-5xl">What we <span class="text-gradient">stand</span> for</h2>
          <p class="text-base italic text-muted-foreground md:text-lg">What guides us when no one is watching.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="principles-carousel mx-auto mt-10 w-full max-w-3xl" data-principles-carousel>
          <div class="principles-viewport">
            <div class="principles-track" data-principles-track>

            <article class="principle-card rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card p-7 transition-all hover:border-primary/30 hover:shadow-md md:p-8" data-principle-card>
              <div class="principle-icon grid h-12 w-12 place-items-center rounded-2xl bg-primary/10 text-primary"><i data-lucide="heart-handshake" class="!h-6 !w-6"></i></div>
              <h3 class="mt-6 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Relentless client partnership</h3>
              <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">We embed deeply, think long-term, and stay committed until the outcomes are real and lasting.</p>
              <p class="mt-5 text-sm italic text-primary/90">We stay until the outcomes are real.</p>
            </article>

            <article class="principle-card rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card p-7 transition-all hover:border-primary/30 hover:shadow-md md:p-8" data-principle-card>
              <div class="principle-icon grid h-12 w-12 place-items-center rounded-2xl bg-primary/10 text-primary"><i data-lucide="flag" class="!h-6 !w-6"></i></div>
              <h3 class="mt-6 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Courage to lead</h3>
              <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">We tackle the problems others find too complex, too ambiguous, or too risky. We go where others won't.</p>
              <p class="mt-5 text-sm italic text-primary/90">We go where others won't.</p>
            </article>

            <article class="principle-card rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card p-7 transition-all hover:border-primary/30 hover:shadow-md md:p-8" data-principle-card>
              <div class="principle-icon grid h-12 w-12 place-items-center rounded-2xl bg-primary/10 text-primary"><i data-lucide="shield-check" class="!h-6 !w-6"></i></div>
              <h3 class="mt-6 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Integrity in every engagement</h3>
              <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">We say what we mean and deliver what we promise. Real partnership is built on trust and transparency.</p>
              <p class="mt-5 text-sm italic text-primary/90">Honest counsel. Always.</p>
            </article>

            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="principles-controls mx-auto mt-6 flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-border bg-background px-2.5 py-1.5 shadow-sm" aria-label="Principles carousel controls">
            <button class="principle-dot" type="button" aria-label="Show partnership principle" data-principles-tab="0"></button>
            <button class="principle-dot" type="button" aria-label="Show courage principle" data-principles-tab="1"></button>
            <button class="principle-dot" type="button" aria-label="Show integrity principle" data-principles-tab="2"></button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-10 lg:py-14">
    <div class="container-x">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl space-y-3 text-center">
        <p class="about-kicker">Capability proof</p>
        <h2 class="text-balance text-4xl font-semibold leading-[1.05] tracking-tight md:text-5xl">Certified <span class="text-gradient">specialists</span> across the stack</h2>
        <p class="text-pretty text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Our engineers and architects hold deep credentials across cloud, data, and AI platforms.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cert-grid mx-auto mt-10 grid max-w-5xl gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">

          <article class="cert-card rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-6">
            <div class="cert-meta"><span>AWS</span><span class="cert-status"><i data-lucide="badge-check" class="!h-3.5 !w-3.5"></i> Verified</span></div>
            <div class="cert-main"><div class="cert-icon grid h-11 w-11 place-items-center rounded-2xl bg-primary/10 text-primary"><i data-lucide="blocks" class="!h-5 !w-5"></i></div><div><p class="cert-type">Professional</p><h3>Solutions Architect</h3></div></div>
            <p class="cert-issuer">Amazon Web Services</p>
          </article>

          <article class="cert-card rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-6">
            <div class="cert-meta"><span>AWS</span><span class="cert-status"><i data-lucide="badge-check" class="!h-3.5 !w-3.5"></i> Verified</span></div>
            <div class="cert-main"><div class="cert-icon grid h-11 w-11 place-items-center rounded-2xl bg-primary/10 text-primary"><i data-lucide="brain-circuit" class="!h-5 !w-5"></i></div><div><p class="cert-type">Specialty</p><h3>Machine Learning</h3></div></div>
            <p class="cert-issuer">Amazon Web Services</p>
          </article>

          <article class="cert-card rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-6">
            <div class="cert-meta"><span>AWS</span><span class="cert-status"><i data-lucide="badge-check" class="!h-3.5 !w-3.5"></i> Verified</span></div>
            <div class="cert-main"><div class="cert-icon grid h-11 w-11 place-items-center rounded-2xl bg-primary/10 text-primary"><i data-lucide="git-branch" class="!h-5 !w-5"></i></div><div><p class="cert-type">Professional</p><h3>DevOps Engineer</h3></div></div>
            <p class="cert-issuer">Amazon Web Services</p>
          </article>

          <article class="cert-card rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-6">
            <div class="cert-meta"><span>AWS</span><span class="cert-status"><i data-lucide="badge-check" class="!h-3.5 !w-3.5"></i> Verified</span></div>
            <div class="cert-main"><div class="cert-icon grid h-11 w-11 place-items-center rounded-2xl bg-primary/10 text-primary"><i data-lucide="database-zap" class="!h-5 !w-5"></i></div><div><p class="cert-type">Specialty</p><h3>Data Engineer</h3></div></div>
            <p class="cert-issuer">Amazon Web Services</p>
          </article>

          <article class="cert-card rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-6">
            <div class="cert-meta"><span>AI</span><span class="cert-status"><i data-lucide="badge-check" class="!h-3.5 !w-3.5"></i> Verified</span></div>
            <div class="cert-main"><div class="cert-icon grid h-11 w-11 place-items-center rounded-2xl bg-primary/10 text-primary"><i data-lucide="sparkles" class="!h-5 !w-5"></i></div><div><p class="cert-type">Learning Credential</p><h3>Claude Skilljar</h3></div></div>
            <p class="cert-issuer">Anthropic</p>
          </article>

          <article class="cert-card rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-6">
            <div class="cert-meta"><span>AWS</span><span class="cert-status"><i data-lucide="badge-check" class="!h-3.5 !w-3.5"></i> Verified</span></div>
            <div class="cert-main"><div class="cert-icon grid h-11 w-11 place-items-center rounded-2xl bg-primary/10 text-primary"><i data-lucide="wand-sparkles" class="!h-5 !w-5"></i></div><div><p class="cert-type">AI Capability</p><h3>Generative AI</h3></div></div>
            <p class="cert-issuer">Amazon Web Services</p>
          </article>

          <article class="cert-card rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-6">
            <div class="cert-meta"><span>AI</span><span class="cert-status"><i data-lucide="badge-check" class="!h-3.5 !w-3.5"></i> Verified</span></div>
            <div class="cert-main"><div class="cert-icon grid h-11 w-11 place-items-center rounded-2xl bg-primary/10 text-primary"><i data-lucide="bot" class="!h-5 !w-5"></i></div><div><p class="cert-type">Foundations</p><h3>CCAF</h3></div></div>
            <p class="cert-issuer">Claude Certified Architect Foundations</p>
          </article>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-10 lg:py-14">
    <div class="container-x">
      <div class="grid gap-10 rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card p-10 md:grid-cols-2 md:items-center md:p-14">
        <div class="space-y-5">

          <p class="about-kicker">Senior delivery</p>
          <h2 class="text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight md:text-5xl">A senior team, built for <span class="text-gradient">complex systems</span>.</h2>
          <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">From staff engineers who've shipped at hyperscale, to ML researchers building agentic systems — we bring the seniority your most ambitious initiatives deserve.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">

            <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-background p-6">
              <p class="text-3xl font-semibold text-gradient">10+</p>
              <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Certified AI & Cloud Engineers</p>
            </div>

            <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-background p-6">
              <p class="text-3xl font-semibold text-gradient">12+</p>
              <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Years avg. experience</p>
            </div>

            <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-background p-6">
              <p class="text-3xl font-semibold text-gradient">7+</p>
              <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Industries and Growing</p>
            </div>

            <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-background p-6">
              <p class="text-3xl font-semibold text-gradient">4</p>
              <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Global delivery hubs</p>
            </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-12 lg:py-16 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="container-x">
      <div class="space-y-3">

        <p class="about-kicker">Journey</p>
        <h2 class="text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight md:text-5xl">Milestones that define us</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="journey-scroll mt-8">
        <div class="journey-roadmap">
          <div class="journey-road" aria-hidden="true"></div>

          <article class="journey-stop" style="--x:10%;">
            <p class="journey-date">2023</p>
            <div class="journey-content"><h3>Algorims founded in Singapore</h3><p>Built to be the one partner for cloud, DevOps, and agentic AI.</p></div>
            <span class="journey-stem" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span class="journey-pin" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </article>
          <article class="journey-stop journey-lower" style="--x:30%;">
            <p class="journey-date">2024</p>
            <div class="journey-content"><h3>Global expansion</h3><p>Expanded globally with a second office in India.</p></div>
            <span class="journey-stem" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span class="journey-pin" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </article>
          <article class="journey-stop" style="--x:50%;">
            <p class="journey-date">2024</p>
            <div class="journey-content"><h3>AWS Advanced Consulting Partner</h3><p>Achieved AWS Advanced Consulting Partner status.</p></div>
            <span class="journey-stem" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span class="journey-pin" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </article>
          <article class="journey-stop journey-lower" style="--x:70%;">
            <p class="journey-date">2025</p>
            <div class="journey-content"><h3>Agentic AI practice launched</h3><p>Deploying autonomous systems for enterprise clients across Singapore.</p></div>
            <span class="journey-stem" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span class="journey-pin" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </article>
          <article class="journey-stop journey-today" style="--x:90%;">
            <p class="journey-date">Today</p>
            <div class="journey-content"><h3>40+ projects. 20+ SMEs.</h3><p>99.9% uptime. 24/7 support. Growing every day.</p></div>
            <span class="journey-stem" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span class="journey-pin" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
<script>
  const roadmap = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.journey-roadmap');
  if (roadmap && !matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches) {
    const stops = [...roadmap.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('.journey-stop')];
    let next = 0;
    const reveal = () => {
      if (next === stops.length) {
        stops.forEach((stop) => stop.classList.remove('is-visible'));
        next = 0;
        setTimeout(reveal, 350);
        return;
      }
      stops[next++].classList.add('is-visible');
      setTimeout(reveal, next === stops.length ? 2400 : 750);
    };
    const observer = new IntersectionObserver(([entry]) => {
      if (!entry.isIntersecting) return;
      roadmap.classList.add('is-animated');
      reveal();
      observer.disconnect();
    }, { threshold: .25 });
    observer.observe(roadmap);
  }

  const principles = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-principles-carousel]');
  if (principles) {
    const track = principles.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-principles-track]');
    const cards = [...principles.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-principle-card]')];
    const tabs = [...principles.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-principles-tab]')];
    const reducedMotion = matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
    let active = 0;
    let timer: ReturnType<typeof setTimeout> | undefined;

    const show = (index: number) => {
      active = (index + cards.length) % cards.length;
      if (track) track.style.transform = `translateX(-${active * 100}%)`;
      cards.forEach((card, i) => card.setAttribute('aria-hidden', String(i !== active)));
      tabs.forEach((tab, i) => tab.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(i === active)));
    };
    const start = () => {
      clearTimeout(timer);
      if (!reducedMotion) timer = setTimeout(() => {
        show(active + 1);
        start();
      }, 5200);
    };
    const restart = () => {
      start();
    };

    tabs.forEach((tab, i) => tab.addEventListener('click', () => { show(i); restart(); }));
    principles.addEventListener('mouseenter', () => clearTimeout(timer));
    principles.addEventListener('mouseleave', start);
    show(0);
    start();
  }
</script>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
  .about-kicker {
    margin: 0;
    color: hsl(var(--primary));
    font-size: .72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: .18em;
    line-height: 1.4;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .about-hero {
    padding-top: 46px;
    padding-bottom: 24px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid hsl(var(--border));
  }

  .about-hero :global(.container-x > .grid) {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 34px;
  }

  .about-hero :global(.lg\:col-span-7) {
    max-width: 900px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .about-hero :global(.lg\:col-span-5) {
    width: 100%;
  }

  .about-page > section:not(.about-hero) {
    border-top: 1px solid hsl(var(--border));
  }

  .about-page > section:nth-of-type(4),
  .about-page > section:nth-of-type(6) {
    background: hsl(var(--muted) / .22);
  }

  .about-hero h1 {
    max-width: 1050px;
    margin-inline: auto;
    font-size: clamp(2.7rem, 5.2vw, 4.8rem);
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -.06em;
  }

  .about-hero :global(.text-lg) {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  .about-hero h1 span {
    color: hsl(var(--primary));
  }

  .about-hero h1 .nowrap {
    color: inherit;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .about-hero .text-gradient {
    background-image: none;
    color: hsl(var(--primary));
  }

  .about-page h2,
  .about-page h3 {
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .about-page :global(.container-x > .space-y-3),
  .about-page :global(.max-w-3xl.space-y-5) {
    max-width: 760px;
  }

  .about-page :global(.rounded-3xl),
  .about-page :global(.rounded-2xl) {
    border-radius: 1.5rem;
  }

  .about-page :global(.bg-card),
  .about-page :global(.bg-secondary\/40) {
    background: hsl(var(--background));
  }

  .about-page :global(.hover\:shadow-md:hover) {
    box-shadow: none;
  }

  .about-page :global(.rounded-3xl.border),
  .about-page :global(.rounded-2xl.border) {
    transition: border-color .2s ease, background .2s ease;
  }

  .about-page :global(.rounded-3xl.border:hover),
  .about-page :global(.rounded-2xl.border:hover) {
    border-color: hsl(var(--primary) / .45);
    background: hsl(var(--muted) / .35);
  }

  .about-page :global(.text-gradient) {
    background-image: none;
    color: hsl(var(--primary));
  }

  .about-page :global(.border-t.border-border.pt-12) {
    margin-top: 48px;
    padding-top: 42px;
  }

  .about-page :global(.mission-card) {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    transform: translateY(0);
  }

  .about-page :global(.mission-card::before) {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0 0 auto;
    height: 3px;
    background: hsl(var(--primary));
    transform: scaleX(0);
    transform-origin: left;
    transition: transform .25s ease;
  }

  .about-page :global(.mission-card:hover) {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
  }

  .about-page :global(.mission-card:hover::before) {
    transform: scaleX(1);
  }

  .about-page :global(.mission-card:hover .mission-icon) {
    background: hsl(var(--primary));
    color: hsl(var(--primary-foreground));
    transform: rotate(-4deg) scale(1.04);
  }

  .about-page :global(.mission-icon) {
    transition: background .2s ease, color .2s ease, transform .2s ease;
  }

  .about-page :global(.principles-viewport) {
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .about-page :global(.principles-track) {
    display: flex;
    transition: transform .38s ease;
    will-change: transform;
  }

  .about-page :global(.principle-card) {
    flex: 0 0 100%;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    animation: principle-rise .55s ease both;
  }

  .about-page :global(.principle-card:hover) {
    transform: translateY(-5px);
  }

  .about-page :global(.principle-card:hover .principle-icon) {
    background: hsl(var(--primary));
    color: hsl(var(--primary-foreground));
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .about-page :global(.principle-icon) {
